Instructions: for this opportunity, generate a personalized outreach email draft using the template type specified that reads account health signals with the data provided for context. If Last Activity is Null, consider it as No activity in the past. Don't mention the Opportunity Id anywhere. The tone of the email should adjust according to Template Type is for Nurturing use Nurturing Tone and when its Urgent use Urgent Tone.
Keep professional, concise and brief.

